            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The data represent a typical SMD type diode for surface mounting, used in the information and communication technology. Material data are taken from datasheets of producers of such diodes and from the literature. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset represents 1 kg of diodes with a weight of 32 miligram/unit. For all diode types, it is assumed the the material composition remains the same over the years (2023 updates).; UUID: 979e2eb7-9329-3843-bc6a-9fd8e4ad171b</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
