                <descriptionOfRestrictions xml:lang="en">Data represent a global valuable composition of SMD type diodes.</descriptionOfRestrictions>
            </locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction>
        </geography>
        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">average diode production technology, comprising the diode wafer production (cleaing, masking, etching, doping, oxidising, metal deposition) and the final assembly of the diode (wafer sawing, die bonding, moulding, trimming and forming)\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of currently used SMD diodes for surface mounting technology.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
